00:06:38.487 --> 00:06:42.519
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:06:43.120 --> 00:06:47.175
<v Slow>赤ちゃんの名前は何ですか。

00:06:47.975 --> 00:06:53.160
<v Host>Their names mean Star and Sky — schoolchildren from the islands chose them.

00:06:53.759 --> 00:06:58.608
<v Slow>赤ちゃんは、どこで生まれましたか。

00:06:59.408 --> 00:07:04.375
<v Host>On a sandy beach in the Ogasawara Islands, far south of Tokyo.

00:07:04.975 --> 00:07:11.624
