00:07:12.423 --> 00:07:17.031
<v Host>It will return them to the sea of Ogasawara after raising them for about a year.

00:07:17.632 --> 00:07:25.072
<v Host>That's all for today. Good luck, little turtles — grow big and swim home safely. See you next time.

00:07:25.672 --> 00:07:28.072
<v News>また明日。
